      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Cloud Pub/Sub**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Pub/Sub for the managed messaging service. I need to make sure this choice is concretely represented within the `publish_event.py` file. I'm thinking about how to architect the code to specifically identify the external provider.\n\n\n**Implementing Pub/Sub Logic**\n\nI'm now deep into implementing the `publish_event.py` file. I'm leveraging the Google Cloud Pub/Sub client library, having created a `PublisherClient` instance. The core function is taking shape, designed to accept a topic ID and a JSON message. I'm focusing on handling the JSON encoding to bytes correctly to ensure proper message delivery. My plan is to make the use of this library as simple as possible.\n\n\n",
